{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2011-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1323993600, "end_date": 1324684799, "month_true_total": 254, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:45:21 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "460061", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970781890", "personaname": "Auld_Wolf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Auld_Wolf/", "num_games_owned": 1095, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 486, "last_played": 1755354727, "avatar": "f3d05db4d8557efbcdbfb337f4176abe9fcb5c1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Everything a shooter should be in my view.. mindless, blood fest.. wicked fun!", "timestamp_created": 1324678406, "timestamp_updated": 1324678406, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "555932", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972135368", "personaname": "The King in Yellow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972135368/", "num_games_owned": 2089, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 3693, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3653, "last_played": 1418254157, "avatar": "9adf1732425e72d0e822492ca5418efaa3bacb07"}, "language": "english", "review": "My undisputed top pic for 2011. Mark my words as this is the first time I have ever felt like I stole this title by not paying the initial retail of $50, it's simply that good. Visceral combat, stunning visuals, and even the attention to such minor details from the 40k fanchise make the best TPS I have EVER played. It's fun and simple but never feels striped down. This game is proof that a TPS can be made in the current era w/o the \"pin to cover\" mechanic that many feel is necessary. The difficult is definatly there for serious gamers, and affords many styles of game play. Combat is hightened by the stun to exicute mechanic to recover health mid-fight. Orcs no longer become fearsome foes, but tasty mobile health packs. Even the multiplayer feels right. Exterminatus is like Last Stand but with more control, and it feels great to blast through waves of foes in this arena style combat. In versus, hunt down the opposing faction. \"Purge the Alien, the Mutant, the Heretic.\"", "timestamp_created": 1324673011, "timestamp_updated": 1324673011, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "436467", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970609667", "personaname": "Generic Roughneck", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Webbysan/", "num_games_owned": 704, "num_reviews": 119, "playtime_forever": 1209, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 528, "last_played": 1670611071, "avatar": "ce4ce5647cde21a56365fca0ad86ebab8645fd64"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not as bad as everyone said it was tbh.  Turns out its a good old hack & shoot...  um, slash.  Would have been loads better if they added a RPG element to it, something like Dawn of War perhaps, skill trees.  But aside from that, i quite enjoyed it.  \n\nI give it a healthy 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1324670942, "timestamp_updated": 1324670942, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2608402", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009968615", "personaname": "Kui the Kui", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kuitehkui/", "num_games_owned": 1277, "num_reviews": 119, "playtime_forever": 1340, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1167, "last_played": 1429205803, "avatar": "18c28cdf22b108e7674fa46dedb544f167fba1cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine is a lot of fun for fluff lovers and newcomers to the 40k universe! The campaign may be very blunt and sometimes boring, but the multiplayer is a wonnderful replacement to the dusty tau fire warrior discs in the corners of your collection. ^^", "timestamp_created": 1324668932, "timestamp_updated": 1324668932, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3542668", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024458341", "personaname": "Moobill", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ilovetomoyo/", "num_games_owned": 429, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1157, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1157, "last_played": 1324713600, "avatar": "8027b572d764261017d2949cefbb61baa9048cc7"}, "language": "english", "review": "many bugs :-(", "timestamp_created": 1324634958, "timestamp_updated": 1324634958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}